  "description": {
   "en": "Kei Maebara-chan Gets a Job!! \nThe bizarre and eerie world of public service, depicted by Ryukishi07, from \"Higurashi When They Cry.\"\n\nIn the 13th year of the Heisei era, in the Tokyo Metropolitan Area, Coastal Region. \n\nDue to the prolonged economic recession, the police force has weakened, and the growing number of disillusioned youth turning to semi-criminal lifestyles has led to a drastic decline in public safety… \nAmidst all this, Kei Maebara begins working at the district office. \nCan he become a respectable public servant? \n\n(Source: Young Champion)"
  },
